BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Town of Black Mountain
DESCRIPTION:This is a free public workshop to educate citizens on the 100-y
 ear regulated floodplain and the requirements for property owners inside t
 he floodplain\, as well as information about the National Flood Insurance 
 Program (NFIP). Terry Foxx\, NFIP Planner\, Western Branch\, with NC Dept.
  of Public Safety\, will give a presentation and will also answer any ques
 tions citizens have related to the regulated floodplain and the NFIP. This
  meeting will be held at Black Mountain Town Hall Council Chambers\, 160 M
 idland Ave.\, Black Mountain\, NC 28711 and is open to all residents.  \n 
 https://www.townofblackmountain.org/calendar.aspx?EID=2326
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260804T183000
